      <a href="#retail" class="featured-card">

        <div class="featured-content">

          <div class="project-category">
            AI / COMPUTER VISION
          </div>

          <h2>
            AI-Powered Retail
            Intelligence Platform
          </h2>

          <p>
            A privacy-focused retail intelligence platform
            that converts live video into useful store analytics.
          </p>

          <ul>

            <li>
              Real-time footfall, movement and dwell-time analytics
            </li>

            <li>
              Anonymous tracking, entry/exit counting and heatmaps
            </li>

            <li>
              Queue estimation and 5/10-minute congestion prediction
            </li>

            <li>
              FastAPI + WebSockets + SQLite/SQLAlchemy
            </li>

            <li>
              Edge-oriented architecture with YOLO/ByteTrack
              and ONNX support
            </li>

          </ul>

          <span class="read-more">
            Read project details →
          </span>

        </div>


